	column 'Total Cost' = ```
			
			VAR CostF0 =
			    CALCULATE (
			        SUMX (
			            'Jira Demand Cost Year',
			            VALUE (
			                'Jira Demand Cost Year'[Local_cost]
			            ) 
			        ),
			        CONTAINSSTRING ( 'Jira Demand Cost Year'[Issue Scenario Name], "F0" )
			    )
			
			VAR CostB0 =
			    CALCULATE (
			        SUMX (
			            'Jira Demand Cost Year',
			            VALUE (
			                 'Jira Demand Cost Year'[Local_cost]
			            )
			        ),
			        CONTAINSSTRING ( 'Jira Demand Cost Year'[Issue Scenario Name], "B0" )
			    )
			
			RETURN
			    COALESCE ( CostF0, CostB0, 0 )
			```
		lineageTag: 4bcef245-7527-4f1e-b5c8-267674925b2f
		summarizeBy: sum

		changedProperty = Name

		annotation SummarizationSetBy = Automatic

		annotation PBI_FormatHint = {"isGeneralNumber":true}

